# Owner patterns for scripts/privacy_check.sh. Copy this file to .githooks/patterns.local
# (git-ignored) or ~/.config/gatbox-family/patterns.local, or point CABCRAWL_HOOK_PATTERNS
# at your copy, and replace the examples with your own values.
#
# One extended regex per line (grep -E, case-sensitive). Blank lines and lines starting
# with # are skipped. A match is never printed, only the file and line where it is.
#
# Examples (invented):
#   Venue Name Here
#   [Ss]omeone [Ll]astname
#   tracker\.yourdomain\.example
